    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/2a4006e593f401e954e57b0abce869a5.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/2a4006e593f401e954e57b0abce869a5.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/2a4006e593f401e954e57b0abce869a5.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betrayal and darkness have torn the queen from her home. Trapped in a sinister parallel world, she must fight for survival, defeat her enemies, and push back the darkness\u2014hoping to one day reclaim her rightful throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/2a6e344391a34f05f3eb4bb4b36dbf52.avif?t=1741104770\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Queen\u2019s Revenge</strong>, you don\u2019t just command from above\u2014you fight on the front lines. As the queen, you must balance <strong>strategic base-building</strong> and <strong>intense combat</strong>.  <br>\ud83c\udf1e <strong>Day Phase:</strong> Expand your territory by defeating enemies and unlocking new construction sites. Every action consumes <strong>day stamina</strong>, forcing careful planning.  <br>\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Night Phase:</strong> Hold the line against waves of enemies, using skill-based combat to protect your stronghold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of <strong>deep strategy and dynamic action</strong> creates a unique challenge where <strong>every choice matters</strong>. Can you outlast the darkness and reclaim your throne?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/ef7fc77feb7e7d7e4e29abe102f87608.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>The game is currently in the <strong>prototype phase</strong>. Screenshots and GIFs do not represent the final version\u2014features like enemy death animations are still in development</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/5e50b693aa34111168ee420a06efdc45.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully plan your defenses to counter both <strong>air and ground units</strong>. Build specialized towers to target different enemy types\u2014anti-air turrets for flying threats and powerful ground defenses for heavily armored foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/090cd2391a7a6cf94129201268158e8d.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/090cd2391a7a6cf94129201268158e8d.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/090cd2391a7a6cf94129201268158e8d.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/fe540e23bfb493ceeb3854a4909e88a8.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategic action game with <strong>skill-based, direct combat</strong>, featuring dodging, blocking, and precise attacks where timing and smart maneuvers determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6846f1e52abcbac960ff0d3add009847.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6846f1e52abcbac960ff0d3add009847.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6846f1e52abcbac960ff0d3add009847.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/728824b5ce3187f544b69fff2620d49b.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for new building sites! Enemy camps guard valuable land\u2014defeat all enemies in a camp during the day to unlock new construction spots for your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/e45e5718a204948c8172f15ee4ba37f4.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/e45e5718a204948c8172f15ee4ba37f4.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/e45e5718a204948c8172f15ee4ba37f4.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/9e9d969cf841a9664837b4d6ae136bea.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless enemy waves! Each night, foes attack in increasing numbers\u2014use your defenses wisely and fight strategically to protect your camp until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/35b0476ff71c978dcac793229065c949.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/35b0476ff71c978dcac793229065c949.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/35b0476ff71c978dcac793229065c949.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/9626a68bc962e6ec0d3f427950b3de82.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span>Strategically place <strong>walls and barriers</strong> to funnel enemies into kill zones, forcing them through choke points where your defenses are strongest. Adapt your layout to exploit enemy weaknesses and ensure your queen\u2019s survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6063b8534c952080c6a3ce6ef7ac146f.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6063b8534c952080c6a3ce6ef7ac146f.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6063b8534c952080c6a3ce6ef7ac146f.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/ffff7f127e8038ec96f5739697467f3a.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join My Community!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of the journey! I want to shape this game <strong>together with you</strong>\u2014your ideas, feedback, and passion will help make it truly great. Let\u2019s create something awesome <strong>as a community!</strong> \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/2a4006e593f401e954e57b0abce869a5.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/2a4006e593f401e954e57b0abce869a5.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/2a4006e593f401e954e57b0abce869a5.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betrayal and darkness have torn the queen from her home. Trapped in a sinister parallel world, she must fight for survival, defeat her enemies, and push back the darkness\u2014hoping to one day reclaim her rightful throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/2a6e344391a34f05f3eb4bb4b36dbf52.avif?t=1741104770\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Queen\u2019s Revenge</strong>, you don\u2019t just command from above\u2014you fight on the front lines. As the queen, you must balance <strong>strategic base-building</strong> and <strong>intense combat</strong>.  <br>\ud83c\udf1e <strong>Day Phase:</strong> Expand your territory by defeating enemies and unlocking new construction sites. Every action consumes <strong>day stamina</strong>, forcing careful planning.  <br>\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Night Phase:</strong> Hold the line against waves of enemies, using skill-based combat to protect your stronghold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of <strong>deep strategy and dynamic action</strong> creates a unique challenge where <strong>every choice matters</strong>. Can you outlast the darkness and reclaim your throne?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/ef7fc77feb7e7d7e4e29abe102f87608.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>The game is currently in the <strong>prototype phase</strong>. Screenshots and GIFs do not represent the final version\u2014features like enemy death animations are still in development</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/5e50b693aa34111168ee420a06efdc45.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully plan your defenses to counter both <strong>air and ground units</strong>. Build specialized towers to target different enemy types\u2014anti-air turrets for flying threats and powerful ground defenses for heavily armored foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/090cd2391a7a6cf94129201268158e8d.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/090cd2391a7a6cf94129201268158e8d.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/090cd2391a7a6cf94129201268158e8d.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/fe540e23bfb493ceeb3854a4909e88a8.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategic action game with <strong>skill-based, direct combat</strong>, featuring dodging, blocking, and precise attacks where timing and smart maneuvers determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6846f1e52abcbac960ff0d3add009847.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6846f1e52abcbac960ff0d3add009847.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6846f1e52abcbac960ff0d3add009847.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/728824b5ce3187f544b69fff2620d49b.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for new building sites! Enemy camps guard valuable land\u2014defeat all enemies in a camp during the day to unlock new construction spots for your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/e45e5718a204948c8172f15ee4ba37f4.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/e45e5718a204948c8172f15ee4ba37f4.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/e45e5718a204948c8172f15ee4ba37f4.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/9e9d969cf841a9664837b4d6ae136bea.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless enemy waves! Each night, foes attack in increasing numbers\u2014use your defenses wisely and fight strategically to protect your camp until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/35b0476ff71c978dcac793229065c949.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/35b0476ff71c978dcac793229065c949.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/35b0476ff71c978dcac793229065c949.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/9626a68bc962e6ec0d3f427950b3de82.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span>Strategically place <strong>walls and barriers</strong> to funnel enemies into kill zones, forcing them through choke points where your defenses are strongest. Adapt your layout to exploit enemy weaknesses and ensure your queen\u2019s survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6063b8534c952080c6a3ce6ef7ac146f.poster.avif?t=1741104770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6063b8534c952080c6a3ce6ef7ac146f.webm?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/6063b8534c952080c6a3ce6ef7ac146f.mp4?t=1741104770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316830/extras/ffff7f127e8038ec96f5739697467f3a.avif?t=1741104770\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join My Community!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of the journey! I want to shape this game <strong>together with you</strong>\u2014your ideas, feedback, and passion will help make it truly great. Let\u2019s create something awesome <strong>as a community!</strong> \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
